# STIG CD16-00-002900: Database objects (including but not limited to tables, index
# STIG ID: V-261884 (MEDIUM)

META
    esp_id `pg16-cd16-00-002900-db-object-ownership-001`
    version `1.0.0`
    dsl_schema_version `1.0.0`
    platform `pg16`
    criticality `high`

    title `STIG CD16-00-002900: Database objects (including but not limited to tables, indexes, storage, stored `
    description `Database objects (including but not limited to tables, indexes, storage, stored procedures, functions, triggers, links to software external to the DBMS, etc.) must be owned by database/PostgreSQL prin`
    author `example-security`
    tags `pg16,stig,disa-stig`

    control_mapping `DISA-STIG:CD16-00-002900,NIST-800-53:CM-5(6)`
    control_objective `CM-5(6)`

    assessment_method `TEST`
    implementation_status `implemented`
    responsible_role `dba`

    control_origination `sp-system`
    inherited_from `PostgreSQL16:localhost:pg-hardening`
    customer_responsibility `configuration`

    remediation_days `30`
    recommendation `Review and remediate per DISA STIG guidance for CD16-00-002900.`

    component_id `comp-pg16-db`

    impl_CM_5_6 `This control is validated by checking the required PostgreSQL configuration against the DISA STIG baseline.`

META_END

DEF
    OBJECT pg_query
        query `role_attributes`
    OBJECT_END

    STATE query_check
        found boolean = true
    STATE_END

    CRI AND
        CTN pg_catalog_query
            TEST all all AND
            STATE_REF query_check
            OBJECT_REF pg_query
        CTN_END
    CRI_END
DEF_END
